msgstr "世嘉 - Dreamcast/Naomi (Flycast)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Flycast is a fork of Reicast, a multi-platform Sega Dreamcast emulator."
msgstr "Flycast 是 Reicast 的一个分支，是一个多平台的世嘉 Dreamcast 模拟器。"

