msgctxt "#30076"
msgid "Force use of high-level emulation BIOS."
msgstr "强制使用高级模拟 BIOS。"

msgctxt "#30077"
msgid "Per-Strip (fast, least accurate)"
msgstr "按条带（快速，最不精确）"

msgctxt "#30078"
msgid "Per-Triangle (normal)"
msgstr "按三角形（正常）"

msgctxt "#30079"
msgid "Per-Pixel (accurate, but slowest)"
msgstr "按像素（精确，但最慢）"

msgctxt "#30080"
msgid "Speeds up GD-ROM loading."
msgstr "加快 GD-ROM 的加载速度。"

msgctxt "#30083"
msgid "Enable emulation of the Dreamcast's audio DSP (digital signal processor). Improves the accuracy of generated sound, but increases performance requirements."
msgstr "启用 Dreamcast 音频 DSP（数字信号处理器）的模拟。可提升生成声音的准确性，但会增加性能需求。"

msgctxt "#30084"
msgid "Runs the GPU and CPU on different threads. Highly recommended."
msgstr "在不同线程上运行 GPU 和 CPU。强烈推荐。"

msgctxt "#30088"
msgid "Video"
msgstr "视频"

msgctxt "#30090"
msgid "Higher values might be required for higher resolutions to output correctly."
msgstr "更高的值可能在更高分辨率下才能正确输出。"

msgctxt "#30091"
msgid "Modify rendering resolution."
msgstr "修改渲染分辨率。"

msgctxt "#30092"
msgid "Horizontal"
msgstr "水平"

msgctxt "#30093"
msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "垂直"

msgctxt "#30094"
msgid "A Dreamcast GPU feature that is typically used by games to draw object shadows. This should normally be enabled - the performance impact is usually minimal to negligible."
msgstr "一项 Dreamcast GPU 特性，通常用于游戏绘制物体阴影。通常应保持启用状态——其对性能的影响通常微乎其微或可忽略不计。"

msgctxt "#30095"
msgid "The output signal type. 'TV (Composite)' is the most widely supported."
msgstr "输出信号类型。“电脑复合（Composite）” 是最广泛支持的。"

msgctxt "#30096"
msgid "PAL-M (Brazil)"
msgstr "PAL-M（巴西）"

msgctxt "#30097"
msgid "PAL-N (Argentina, Paraguay, Uruguay)"
msgstr "PAL-N（阿根廷，巴拉圭，乌拉圭）"

msgctxt "#30098"
